    "ocr_text": "Slide 1 (Cover): \"Stop Using poppins - TRY THESE ALTERNATIVES\". Photoshop 2026 font bar showing Poppins Bold 234.95 pt.\nSlide 2: Font 01: \"Clash Display\" - Style: Fresh & Friendly.\nSlide 3: Font 02: \"Inter\" - Style: Clean & Fresh.\nSlide 4: Font 03: \"Aktiv Grotesk\" - Style: Clean & Expressive.\nSlide 5: Font 04: \"Agoma\" - Style: Neat & Contemporary.\nSlide 6: Font 05: \"Jakarta Sans\" (Plus Jakarta Sans) - Style: Friendly & Flexible.\nSlide 7: Font 06: \"EPIC PRO\" - Style: Powerful & Modern.\nSlide 8: Outro: @uiuxikbal, Contact: ikbalmahmud132@gmail.com, WhatsApp: +8801798-449510. Services: UI/UX Design, Web Design, Branding, Webflow, Framer, WordPress.",
    "extracted_knowledge": "Recommended Alternatives to Poppins font:\n1. Clash Display (Fresh & Friendly - Great for bold display & headings)\n2. Inter (Clean & Fresh - Ideal for UI/UX & body copy)\n3. Aktiv Grotesk (Clean & Expressive - Modern grotesque sans)\n4. Agoma (Neat & Contemporary - Futuristic display)\n5. Plus Jakarta Sans (Friendly & Flexible - Modern sans-serif)\n6. EPIC PRO (Powerful & Modern - Impactful geometric wide heading font)"
