    "caption": "Precision on the plate. Purpose in every pixel.\nFor KAZE Omakase, the concept combines Japanese minimalism with bold editorial typography, keeping the experience refined, immersive, and focused on the craft behind every dish. The oversized type creates impact, while subtle red accents, floating UI cards, generous whitespace, and chef-centered imagery bring together tradition and a modern luxury feel.\nSwipe to see the visual system and design thinking behind the experience.\nWant a website that makes your brand feel unforgettable? DM me “WEBSITE” and let’s create it.\n#webdesign #webdevelopment #websitedesign #uidesign #uxdesign",
