    "ocr_text": "Here is the complete extraction, visual breakdown, typography analysis, and knowledge synthesis from the provided Instagram post.\n\n---\n\n### 📌 Post Overview\n* **Caption**: *\"Stop building basic websites. Start studying websites that push your skills. 3D • Animations • Smooth scroll • Interactions • Creative development. Save this for your next build. 🔖 Comment “DOC” for the full breakdown + build guide.\"*\n* **Category**: Design & Typography / Creative Web Development\n* **Post Link**: `https://www.instagram.com/p/Dc3jgy8Olgz/`\n\n---\n\n### 🖼️ Slide-by-Slide Detailed Extraction\n\n#### **Slide 1 (Single Overview Image)**\n\n##### 1. Visible Overlay Text\n> **\"Stop building basic websites. Build like this.🚀\"**\n\n##### 2. Website Screen UI Content (Ciro Energy Concept)\n* **Header / Brand**: `CIRO ENERGY`\n* **Main Product Heading**: \n  > **ABRICOT FRAMBOISE**\n* **French Body Description**:\n  > *\"Un duo solaire et gourmand. On a mélangé la douceur de l'abricot et la vivacité de la framboise.\"*  \n  *(Translation: A sunny and gourmet duo. We mixed the sweetness of apricot with the liveliness of raspberry.)*\n* **3D Can Render Text**:\n  * Brand Name: `CIRO`\n  * Flavor: `GOÛT ABRICOT FRAMBOISE`\n  * Ingredients/Badges: `caféine guarana` | `faible calorie`\n  * Product Category: `ENERGY`\n* **UI Elements**: Top-right navigation buttons (`MENU`), interactive side widget buttons on the right, and subtle floating background letters (`A`, `B`, `C`, `E`, `F`, `L`) forming an interactive scatter grid.\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Typography & Design Breakdown\n\n* **Headline Typography**:\n  * **Style**: Heavy, ultra-bold, condensed sans-serif (Display typeface).\n  * **Characteristics**: Extended horizontal weight, tight letter-spacing (tracking), aggressive visual presence perfect for modern branding and high-energy product sites.\n  * **Font Inspiration / Matches**: *Monument Extended*, *Druk Wide*, *Syne Heavy*, or *Trash Typeface*.\n\n* **Body Typography**:\n  * **Style**: Clean, geometric sans-serif with neutral readability.\n  * **Font Inspiration / Matches**: *Inter*, *Plus Jakarta Sans*, or *SF Pro Text*.\n\n* **Color Palette & Visuals**:\n  * **Primary Background**: High-contrast deep magenta / crimson gradient (`#D10056` to `#100008`).\n  * **Accent / Foreground**: Pure white (`#FFFFFF`) for crisp readability against the vibrant background.\n  * **3D Asset**: Hyper-realistic 3D energy can render placed dynamically at an angle across the viewport.\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ Key Technical Takeaways & Tech Stack Recommendations\n\nTo build a high-performance creative website like the one shown in this post:\n\n1. **3D Rendering & Scene Management**:\n   * **Three.js** or **React Three Fiber (R3F)** for rendering and manipulating the 3D energy can model in real-time within the browser.\n   * **GLTF / GLB Format**: Export optimized 3D models with compressed PBR (Physically Based Rendering) textures.\n\n2. **Animations & Interactive Canvas**:\n   * **GSAP (GreenSock Animation Platform)**: For scroll-driven camera movements, 3D rotations, and text stagger animations using `ScrollTrigger`.\n   * **Lenis Scroll**: For buttery-smooth custom scroll physics across modern browsers.\n\n3. **Shader Effects & Lighting**:\n   * Custom GLSL fragment shaders for gradient background effects, lighting reflections on the metallic dynamic can surface.\n\n---\n\n### 🏷️ Post Hashtags\n`#WebDevelopment` `#FrontendDevelopment` `#WebDesign` `#CreativeCoding` `#ThreeJS` `#GSAP` `#ReactJS` `#JavaScript` `#UIDesign` `#FrontendDev` `#Coding` `#WebDev`",
