    "caption": "Food delivery websites should make you hungry within the first three seconds. 🍗\n\nFor EATLY, we designed a full food delivery homepage anchored by \"Enjoy Your Delicious Food\" in bold serif type, paired with real, mouth-watering chicken wing photography instead of illustrated icons. A floating \"30 Min Delivery\" badge and a real customer review card \"Arefin Shuvo, Fast delivery at home, 5 stars\" sit directly on the hero image, building trust and urgency without a single extra scroll.\n\nStats below the fold do the rest of the convincing: 500K+ meals served, 4.9/5 average rating, 200+ curated recipes from top chefs, 98% satisfaction. Clean navigation and a clear \"Order Now\" CTA keep the whole experience frictionless from the first glance.\n\nWe design conversion-focused websites for food delivery apps, restaurants, and hospitality brands across London, New York, and Amsterdam where appetite-driven design directly impacts orders.\n\n📩 DM \"SPHERE\" for UI/UX consultation. 🌐",
