    "ocr_text": "Here is the comprehensive text, UI breakdown, and knowledge extraction from the provided image:\n\n---\n\n### **Overview & Branding**\n* **Brand Name:** रंगसेतु (Rangsetu) / Rangsetu B2B Navratri Passes\n* **Tagline:** The Rangsetu Experience is coming soon!\n* **Target Audience:** Corporates, businesses, event organizers, and group bookings across Ahmedabad & Gandhinagar.\n* **Core Value Proposition:** Direct wholesale pass sourcing, guaranteed authentic passes, bulk pricing, and instant delivery.\n\n---\n\n### **Slide / Image Content Breakdown**\n\n#### **1. Top Section (Header & Callout)**\n* **Brand Logo:** `रंगसेतु` *(Calligraphic Devanagari script)*\n* **Main Announcement:**\n  * *\"THE RANGSETU EXPERIENCE\"* *(Classic Serif)*\n  * *\"is coming soon!\"* *(Elegant script/cursive font)*\n  * *\"Our portal is launching soon.\"*\n* **Top Right Note (Paper Pin):**\n  * *\"stay tuned, good things take time.\"* *(Typewriter font)*\n\n---\n\n#### **2. Center Website Mockup (UI/UX Interface)**\n\n* **Navbar:**\n  * **Logo:** रंगसेतु (B2B NAVRATRI PASSES)\n  * **Menu Items:** `Home` | `Available Passes` | `How It Works` | `B2B` | `FAQ` | `Contact`\n  * **CTA Button:** `Request Passes` *(with WhatsApp icon)*\n\n* **Hero Section:**\n  * **Category Badge:** `👑 MANDLI & AC DOME GARBA • AHMEDABAD 2026`\n  * **Main Title:** **Ahmedabad’s Biggest Navratri 2026 Passes. Get Direct B2B Wholesale Rates.**\n  * **Description:** *\"Direct wholesale pass sourcing for corporates, businesses & group bookings across Ahmedabad. Enjoy guaranteed genuine passes, transparent bulk rates & instant WhatsApp delivery.\"*\n\n* **Feature Mini-Cards:**\n  1. **100% Genuine Passes** — Verified & Authentic\n  2. **Direct Wholesale** — B2B Rates\n  3. **Physical & Digital** — Formats Available\n\n* **Primary CTAs:**\n  * `[WhatsApp Icon] Enquire on WhatsApp`\n  * `[Phone Icon] +91 96649 25159`\n\n* **Key Value Badges:**\n  * ✓ Authentic Mandli Passes\n  * ✓ 100% AC Dome Arenas\n  * ✓ Physical & Online Options\n  * ✓ Instant WhatsApp Rates\n\n* **Visual Element (Right Card):**\n  * Tag: `🔥 Popular`\n  * Illustration: Traditional dancers playing Dandiya/Garba in colorful Gujarati attire.\n\n---\n\n#### **3. Floating Trust/Feature Bar (Lower Section)**\n* 🏅 **Trusted by Corporates & Event Organizers**\n* 👥 **Bulk Bookings Made Simple**\n* 🚚💬 **Instant WhatsApp Response**\n* 🛡️ **Secure & Transparent Procurement**\n\n---\n\n#### **4. Footer Banner**\n* **Announcement:** `LAUNCHING SOON • STAY TUNED!`\n* **Sub-text:** `✓ Verified B2B Pass Procurement • Ahmedabad & Gandhinagar`\n\n---\n\n### **Design & Typography Notes**\n* **Color Palette:** Rich Crimson/Maroon (`#8B1E1E`), Ivory/Cream Parchment (`#F9F4EB`), Ochre Gold/Mustard, Warm Neutral Grays.\n* **Art Style:** Traditional Indian Pichwai/etched line-art combined with a modern, clean SaaS/B2B landing page UI card.\n* **Typography Pairing:**\n  * **Headings:** Classical Serif (e.g., *Cinzel* / *Playfair Display*) paired with Script/Calligraphy.\n  * **Body/UI:** Modern clean Sans-Serif (e.g., *Inter* / *Plus Jakarta Sans*).\n  * **Accents:** Typewriter font on kraft paper.",
    "extracted_knowledge": "Here is the comprehensive text, UI breakdown, and knowledge extraction from the provided image:\n\n---\n\n### **Overview & Branding**\n* **Brand Name:** रंगसेतु (Rangsetu) / Rangsetu B2B Navratri Passes\n* **Tagline:** The Rangsetu Experience is coming soon!\n* **Target Audience:** Corporates, businesses, event organizers, and group bookings across Ahmedabad & Gandhinagar.\n* **Core Value Proposition:** Direct wholesale pass sourcing, guaranteed authentic passes, bulk pricing, and instant delivery.\n\n---\n\n### **Slide / Image Content Breakdown**\n\n#### **1. Top Section (Header & Callout)**\n* **Brand Logo:** `रंगसेतु` *(Calligraphic Devanagari script)*\n* **Main Announcement:**\n  * *\"THE RANGSETU EXPERIENCE\"* *(Classic Serif)*\n  * *\"is coming soon!\"* *(Elegant script/cursive font)*\n  * *\"Our portal is launching soon.\"*\n* **Top Right Note (Paper Pin):**\n  * *\"stay tuned, good things take time.\"* *(Typewriter font)*\n\n---\n\n#### **2. Center Website Mockup (UI/UX Interface)**\n\n* **Navbar:**\n  * **Logo:** रंगसेतु (B2B NAVRATRI PASSES)\n  * **Menu Items:** `Home` | `Available Passes` | `How It Works` | `B2B` | `FAQ` | `Contact`\n  * **CTA Button:** `Request Passes` *(with WhatsApp icon)*\n\n* **Hero Section:**\n  * **Category Badge:** `👑 MANDLI & AC DOME GARBA • AHMEDABAD 2026`\n  * **Main Title:** **Ahmedabad’s Biggest Navratri 2026 Passes. Get Direct B2B Wholesale Rates.**\n  * **Description:** *\"Direct wholesale pass sourcing for corporates, businesses & group bookings across Ahmedabad. Enjoy guaranteed genuine passes, transparent bulk rates & instant WhatsApp delivery.\"*\n\n* **Feature Mini-Cards:**\n  1. **100% Genuine Passes** — Verified & Authentic\n  2. **Direct Wholesale** — B2B Rates\n  3. **Physical & Digital** — Formats Available\n\n* **Primary CTAs:**\n  * `[WhatsApp Icon] Enquire on WhatsApp`\n  * `[Phone Icon] +91 96649 25159`\n\n* **Key Value Badges:**\n  * ✓ Authentic Mandli Passes\n  * ✓ 100% AC Dome Arenas\n  * ✓ Physical & Online Options\n  * ✓ Instant WhatsApp Rates\n\n* **Visual Element (Right Card):**\n  * Tag: `🔥 Popular`\n  * Illustration: Traditional dancers playing Dandiya/Garba in colorful Gujarati attire.\n\n---\n\n#### **3. Floating Trust/Feature Bar (Lower Section)**\n* 🏅 **Trusted by Corporates & Event Organizers**\n* 👥 **Bulk Bookings Made Simple**\n* 🚚💬 **Instant WhatsApp Response**\n* 🛡️ **Secure & Transparent Procurement**\n\n---\n\n#### **4. Footer Banner**\n* **Announcement:** `LAUNCHING SOON • STAY TUNED!`\n* **Sub-text:** `✓ Verified B2B Pass Procurement • Ahmedabad & Gandhinagar`\n\n---\n\n### **Design & Typography Notes**\n* **Color Palette:** Rich Crimson/Maroon (`#8B1E1E`), Ivory/Cream Parchment (`#F9F4EB`), Ochre Gold/Mustard, Warm Neutral Grays.\n* **Art Style:** Traditional Indian Pichwai/etched line-art combined with a modern, clean SaaS/B2B landing page UI card.\n* **Typography Pairing:**\n  * **Headings:** Classical Serif (e.g., *Cinzel* / *Playfair Display*) paired with Script/Calligraphy.\n  * **Body/UI:** Modern clean Sans-Serif (e.g., *Inter* / *Plus Jakarta Sans*).\n  * **Accents:** Typewriter font on kraft paper."
